  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span id=\"Rahl.27s_Might\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rahl's_Might\">Rahl's Might</span></h2>\n<table class=\"striped\" style=\"clear: right; border: 1px #CCFF99 solid; margin: 4px; width: 100%; --bg-color-1:#CCFF99;--bg-color-1-dark:#3D5F1A;--bg-color-2:#EEFFCC;--bg-color-2-dark:#272F17;--header-color:#CCFF99;--header-color-dark:#3D5F1A;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #CCFF99; width: 15%;\">Proficiency Class\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEFFCC; width: 42.5%;\">Simple Weapon Proficiency\n</td>\n<th class=\"bg-color-2\" rowspan=\"19\" style=\"background:#EEFFCC;\" width=\"42.5%\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Rahl%27s_Might_shown.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Rahl%27s_Might_shown.jpg/420px-Rahl%27s_Might_shown.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"143\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Rahl%27s_Might_shown.jpg/630px-Rahl%27s_Might_shown.jpg 1.5x, https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Rahl%27s_Might_shown.jpg/840px-Rahl%27s_Might_shown.jpg 2x\" /></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #CCFF99;\">Accepts Sentience?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEFFCC;\">No\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #CCFF99;\">Damage and Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEFFCC;\">2.60[1d11] + 5 Slash, Pierce, Bludgeon, Magic\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #CCFF99;\"><a href=\"/page/Threat_range\" title=\"Threat range\">Critical threat range</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEFFCC;\">20 / x3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #CCFF99;\">Weapon Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEFFCC;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Quarterstaff\" title=\"Quarterstaff\">Quarterstaff</a></b> / Bludgeoning weapons\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Race Absolutely Required\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><a href=\"/page/None\" title=\"None\">None</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #CCFF99;\">Minimum Level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEFFCC;\">18\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Required Trait\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">None\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\"><a href=\"/page/Use_Magical_Device\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Use Magical Device\">Use Magical Device</a> <a href=\"/page/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">No UMD needed\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Handedness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Attack Mod\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">STR\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Damage Mod\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">STR\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Account&#160;on Acquire</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">180\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Made from\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a>:</b> <b>Wood</b> is common for use in <a href=\"/page/Quarterstaff\" title=\"Quarterstaff\">Quarterstaffs</a>, <a href=\"/page/Bow\" title=\"Bow\">bows</a>, or <a href=\"/page/Ammo\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ammo\">ammo</a>. It is light, but its durability is low.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">15\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0020005000</span>20,005<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">4 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Mindsunder\" title=\"The Mindsunder\">The Mindsunder</a></b>, Disc locked optional end chest&#160;; <br /> Chance on every 3rd completion of <a href=\"/page/The_Mindsunder\" title=\"The Mindsunder\">The Mindsunder</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+5 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+5 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +5 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"> Strength +6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"> Strength +6</a></b>: This item gives the wearer the power of Ogre Strength, granting a +6 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Strength.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Improved_Destruction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Improved Destruction\">Improved Destruction</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Improved_Destruction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Improved Destruction\">Improved Destruction</a>:</b> On Hit: Your target gains a stack of Armor Destruction. (-1 penalty to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>, -1% of its <a href=\"/page/Fortification\" title=\"Fortification\">Fortification</a>. 20 Second Duration. Stacks up to 15 times.) This effect may trigger once every second.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a>:</b> This weapon is hard to focus upon and thus provides a +3 enhancement bonus to Bluff checks. In addition, Deception weapons have a small chance to envelop the target in darkness, making them vulnerable to sneak attacks for a short time.</span></span></li>\n<li>One of the following:\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Alignment_damage_(weapon)#Axiomatic\" title=\"Alignment damage (weapon)\">Axiomatic</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Alignment_damage_(weapon)#Axiomatic\" title=\"Alignment damage (weapon)\">Axiomatic</a>:</b> An axiomatic weapon is lawfully aligned and infused with the power of law. It makes the weapon law-aligned and thus bypasses the corresponding damage reduction. It deals an extra 2 to 12 damage against all of <a href=\"/page/Chaotic\" title=\"Chaotic\">chaotic</a> alignment.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Bleed#Bleed\" title=\"Bleed\">Bleed</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Bleed#Bleed\" title=\"Bleed\">Bleed</a>:</b> This weapon is cruelly sharp and will do an additional 1 to 8 damage to targets that are vulnerable to bleeding.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Force_(enchantment)\" title=\"Force (enchantment)\">Force</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Force_(enchantment)\" title=\"Force (enchantment)\">Force</a>:</b> This weapon is humming with magical force. It deals an additional 1 to 6 force damage on a successful hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Impact\" title=\"Impact\">Impact</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Impact\" title=\"Impact\">Impact</a>: </b> Passive: The base critical <a href=\"/page/Threat_range\" title=\"Threat range\">threat range</a> of this weapon is doubled. This does not stack with <a href=\"/page/Improved_Critical\" title=\"Improved Critical\">Improved Critical</a> feat. <a href=\"/page/Vorpal_Strike\" title=\"Vorpal Strike\">Vorpal Strikes</a> by this weapon also bypass all <a href=\"/page/Fortification\" title=\"Fortification\">Fortification</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Shock\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shock\">Shock</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Shock\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shock\">Shock</a>:</b> This weapon is sheathed in crackling electricity. A shock weapon deals an extra 1 to 6 points of electricity damage on a successful hit.</span></span></li></ul></li>\n<li>Hidden Effect: Increases all threat generated by 15%</li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Suppressed_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Suppressed Power\">Suppressed Power</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Suppressed_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Suppressed Power\">Suppressed Power</a>: This psionic item is powerful, but you sense that it has not unlocked all of its secrets to you at this time.</span></span>\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Alignment_damage_(weapon)#Axiomatic\" title=\"Alignment damage (weapon)\">Axiomatic</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Alignment_damage_(weapon)#Axiomatic\" title=\"Alignment damage (weapon)\">Axiomatic</a>:</b> An axiomatic weapon is lawfully aligned and infused with the power of law. It makes the weapon law-aligned and thus bypasses the corresponding damage reduction. It deals an extra 2 to 12 damage against all of <a href=\"/page/Chaotic\" title=\"Chaotic\">chaotic</a> alignment.</span></span> &#8594; <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Axiomatic_Burst#Axiomatic_Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Axiomatic Burst\">Axiomatic Burst</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Axiomatic_Burst#Axiomatic_Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Axiomatic Burst\">Axiomatic Burst</a>:</b> An axiomatic weapon is lawfully aligned and infused with the power of law. It makes the weapon law-aligned and thus bypasses the corresponding damage reduction. It deals an extra 2 to 12 points of damage against all of chaotic alignment and an extra 3 to 18 on a critical for weapons with a x2 critical multiplier, 4 to 24 for a x3 multiplier, and 5 to 30 for a x4 multiplier.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Bleed#Bleed\" title=\"Bleed\">Bleed</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Bleed#Bleed\" title=\"Bleed\">Bleed</a>:</b> This weapon is cruelly sharp and will do an additional 1 to 8 damage to targets that are vulnerable to bleeding.</span></span> &#8594; <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Puncturing\" title=\"Puncturing\">Puncturing</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Puncturing\" title=\"Puncturing\">Puncturing</a>:</b> Critical hits by this weapon deal an extra 1 to 6 points of Constitution damage from blood loss.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Force_(enchantment)\" title=\"Force (enchantment)\">Force</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Force_(enchantment)\" title=\"Force (enchantment)\">Force</a>:</b> This weapon is humming with magical force. It deals an additional 1 to 6 force damage on a successful hit.</span></span> &#8594; <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Force_Burst#Force_Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Burst\">Force Burst</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Force_Burst#Force_Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Burst\">Force Burst</a>:</b> This weapon is humming with magical force, and does 1 to 6 force damage each hit. Critical hits deal an additional 1 to 10 force damage for weapons with a x2 critical multiplier, 2 to 20 for a x3 multiplier and 3 to 30 for a x4 multiplier.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Impact\" title=\"Impact\">Impact</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Impact\" title=\"Impact\">Impact</a>: </b> Passive: The base critical <a href=\"/page/Threat_range\" title=\"Threat range\">threat range</a> of this weapon is doubled. This does not stack with <a href=\"/page/Improved_Critical\" title=\"Improved Critical\">Improved Critical</a> feat. <a href=\"/page/Vorpal_Strike\" title=\"Vorpal Strike\">Vorpal Strikes</a> by this weapon also bypass all <a href=\"/page/Fortification\" title=\"Fortification\">Fortification</a>.</span></span> &#8594; <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Maiming\" title=\"Maiming\">Maiming</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Maiming\" title=\"Maiming\">Maiming</a>:</b> This weapon has a twisted haft or grip and spikes along its blade, head, or point. Whenever you score a critical hit with this weapon it deals an amount of extra untyped damage depending on its critical multiplier: x2 - 1 to 6, x3 - 2 to 12, x4 - 3 to 18.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Shock\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shock\">Shock</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Shock\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shock\">Shock</a>:</b> This weapon is sheathed in crackling electricity. A shock weapon deals an extra 1 to 6 points of electricity damage on a successful hit.</span></span> &#8594; <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Shocking_Burst#Shocking_Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shocking Burst\">Shocking Burst</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Shocking_Burst#Shocking_Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shocking Burst\">Shocking Burst</a>:</b> This weapon is sheathed in crackling electricity, and deals 1 to 6 electric damage each hit. Critical hits deal an additional 1 to 10 electric damage for weapons with a x2 critical multiplier, 2 to 20 for a x3 multiplier and 3 to 30 for a x4 multiplier.</span></span></li>\n<li>Becomes <a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Character&#160;on Acquire</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Rahl%27s_Might.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Rahl%27s_Might.png/420px-Rahl%27s_Might.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"645\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Rahl%27s_Might.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Suppressed_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Suppressed Power\">Suppressed Power</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>This versatile Monk weapon was the favored implement of a hill giant follower of the Path of Inevitable Dominion. Rahl's students created many of these bladed staves, altering their enchantments to suit their desires.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p>Example upgraded version:\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Rahl%27s_Might_(unsuppressed).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Rahl%27s_Might_%28unsuppressed%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"464\" height=\"699\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817224200\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.115 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.273 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6925/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 74099/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 26971/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  238.773      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  238.773      1 -total\n 98.65%  235.556      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 94.60%  225.873    116 Template:IO\n 35.24%   84.137      1 Template:Cp2BV\n 34.24%   81.766      1 Template:BV2cp\n 30.33%   72.409      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 29.92%   71.439      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 29.20%   69.728      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 28.78%   68.710      2 Template:InCategory\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:14797-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817224200 and revision id 678008. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
